1
00:00:06,750 --> 00:00:11,159
It was the only thing on the page we did not paint.

2
00:00:11,350 --> 00:00:15,556
A boat made of paper, in a street made of rain.

3
00:00:20,350 --> 00:00:26,126
We painted the world ahead of it, one bend at a time, and it kept going.

4
00:00:26,350 --> 00:00:29,396
We measured. It did not care.

5
00:00:30,850 --> 00:00:33,138
Then it stopped.

6
00:00:35,150 --> 00:00:39,581
And the sky, which had started this, started it again.

7
00:00:41,850 --> 00:00:47,004
Past the last bridge, the water forgot that it had ever been a gutter.

8
00:00:51,350 --> 00:00:55,408
When the paint dried, the world we made was gone.

9
00:00:56,450 --> 00:01:00,261
Only the part we left alone arrived.
